      ],
      "source": "https://shinglehouseborough.org/history",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1900 the New York & Pennsylvania Railroad arrived, linking Shinglehouse to the Pittsburgh, Shawmut and Northern line.",
